72. mi nanca li civo .ije lo mi nakspe goi la.sam. nanca li cixa .i lo go'i
cu zmadu mi loka se nanca kei li re .i lo mi'a tixnu cu zmadu lo mi'a bersa
loka se nanca kei li vo

Please for the love of all that is good look it over this time. If I don't
hear anything about this within 48 hours I will assume that everyone is
agreeable to it as is and I will upload it to the tiki page.

I did this 2 day waiting period last time too, so I'm hoping the second
time will be more successful than the first. I really don't want to revisit
this in a month /again/ because someone took too long to voice their
thoughts.

And by the way, I consider a response such as "hang on, I haven't finished
looking through it yet" a valid reason to not upload this in 2 days.

